WEBVTT

02:39.999 --> 02:41.083
BOOM

03:32.427 --> 03:33.177
FLIP

04:00.121 --> 04:00.704
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

04:00.788 --> 04:02.915
<i>A demon's crept into
our everyday life</i>

04:02.999 --> 04:05.292
<i>It's about to take away
something precious</i>

04:05.376 --> 04:08.629
<i>Our peace has already
crumbled long ago</i>

04:09.380 --> 04:11.465
<i>So casually, so nonchalantly</i>

04:11.549 --> 04:13.884
<i>It's taken from us
before we know it</i>

04:13.968 --> 04:17.179
<i>If we want it back,
now's the chance</i>

04:17.430 --> 04:20.933
<i>With the sharpness of
the piercing arrow</i>

04:21.726 --> 04:25.104
<i>The beauty of two souls united</i>

04:25.188 --> 04:27.773
<i>Wherever you go, chase you</i>

04:27.857 --> 04:29.984
<i>Whenever, chase you</i>

04:30.067 --> 04:32.069
<i>I will chase you</i>

04:32.153 --> 04:33.737
<i>Nowhere to escape</i>

04:33.821 --> 04:36.406
<i>Start running, I will chase you</i>

04:36.491 --> 04:38.493
<i>Tomorrow, chase you</i>

04:38.576 --> 04:41.287
<i>My fists will be the one
to show you</i>

04:41.496 --> 04:45.996
<i>Tenacity decides
who will win or lose</i>

04:47.168 --> 04:51.668
<i>So I chase you</i>

04:56.302 --> 05:00.802
EPISODE 15
LET'S GO TO
THE MANGA ARTIST'S HOUSE, PART 2

07:47.348 --> 07:49.141
I CANNOT ATTACK
THE MANGA ARTIST, ROHAN KISHIBE

07:49.225 --> 07:52.561
CANNOT

10:29.385 --> 10:32.054
HEAVEN'S DOOR

13:22.891 --> 13:26.811
IF JOSUKE HIGASHIKATA CAUSES
TROUBLE FOR ROHAN KISHIBE,
I WILL BURN MYSELF TO DEATH

14:51.980 --> 14:56.480
SECONDS

19:36.223 --> 19:39.267
YOUR KID IS SICK, RIGHT?
I'll PUSH YOUR CAR.

19:48.860 --> 19:51.112
NOW STEP ON THE GAS.

19:52.447 --> 19:56.451
ONCE YOU GAIN TRACTION,
DON'T STOP. JUST GUN IT…
OR YOU'LL GET STUCK AGAIN.

22:19.469 --> 22:23.969
ROHAN KISHIBE'S
PINK DARK BOY
— SUSPENSION NOTICE —
SORRY!
THANK YOU FOR YOUR CONTINUED
READERSHIP OF PINK DARK BOY.
DUE TO PERSONAL MATTERS,
OUR PUBLICATION WILL BE
SUSPENDED FOR ONE MONTH.
(FROM THE EDITORS)

23:38.632 --> 23:41.509
EPISODE 16
LET'S GO HUNTING!
